  "semantics": "Monthly 1 km NDVI/EVI composites on the MODIS sinusoidal grid (HDF4-EOS). SDS '1 km monthly NDVI' is int16 with scale factor 0.0001 (NDVI = DN * 0.0001; the in-file attribute scale_factor=10000 follows the MODIS convention physical = DN / scale_factor, so do not multiply by it), valid range -2000..10000, fill -3000. Use the '1 km monthly VI Quality' bit field (bits 0-1 MODLAND QA: 00 good, 01 check other QA, 10/11 cloudy/not produced) and 'pixel reliability' to screen pixels. Granule date AYYYYDDD is the first day of the month.",
